{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">國產大型客機C919開通首條國際商業航線。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中國國際航空來往北京至蒙古首都烏蘭巴托的航線，即日起由國產大型客機C919執飛，每日來回各一班。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.C919-1500_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026jkWR1PCBFH1786526723.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.C919-1500_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">東航及南航的C919客機之前曾飛往新加坡、迪拜，進行靜態展示及試飛。而今日是首次執行國際商業航班，代表著C919邁入國際常態化營運新階段。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T09:41:13.560122+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}